title: "Extremizers and independence numbers for small nonunimodal graphs"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-28
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "The 15-vertex nonunimodal witness is unique up to isomorphism, with 75075 labelled copies. At order 16 the possible independence numbers are 5, 6, and 7; prescribed independence numbers 3, 4, 6, 7, and 8 have sharp minimum orders 33, 19, 16, 16, and 17."
